---
import './Flow.css';
---
<div class="flows">
  <div>
    <p class="label flow-name">Indexing</p>
    <ol class="flow">
      <li><span class="step">Documents</span><span class="detail">5,000+, accounting and BPO</span></li>
      <li><span class="step">ETL pipeline</span><span class="detail">ingest · clean · chunk · embed</span></li>
      <li><span class="step">Index</span><span class="detail">each document tagged with its team</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="label flow-name">Asking</p>
    <ol class="flow">
      <li><span class="step">A team member asks</span><span class="detail">React interface</span></li>
      <li><span class="step">Token auth</span><span class="detail">FastAPI service</span></li>
      <li class="key-step"><span class="step">Role-based access</span><span class="detail">which documents may this team read?</span></li>
      <li><span class="step">Retrieval</span><span class="detail">only from what is cleared</span></li>
      <li><span class="step">Answer</span><span class="detail">from the retrieved documents</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
